  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Peel potato, then cut into large chunks.\n• Thinly slice leek.\n• Finely chop carrot.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65dbcad26c7a1d757ffa9098-f48f2a48.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cook potato in the boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 10-15 minutes. Drain and return potato to the saucepan.\n• Add the plant-based milk and a generous drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper, then mash until smooth. Cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65dbcad26c7a1d757ffa9098-d992b22f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook leek and carrot until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add plant-based butter, garlic paste, Mumbai spice blend, mild North Indian spice blend and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 2 minutes.\n• Add lentils, vegetable stock powder, coconut milk, the water and brown sugar. Stir and simmer until thickened, 2-3 minutes. Season with pepper to taste. Stir through baby spinach leaves until wilted, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65dbcad26c7a1d757ffa9098-69df4761.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high. Transfer lentil filling to a baking dish, then top with potato mash.\n• Run a fork over mash to create an uneven surface.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65dbcad26c7a1d757ffa9098-5aa8cb0f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Grill pie until lightly browned, 10-15 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65dbcad26c7a1d757ffa9098-748bf9ba.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Indian lentil and veggie curry pie with mash topping between plates.\n• Sprinkle with chilli flakes (if using) to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65dbcad26c7a1d757ffa9098-8a6b98b0.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
